   278	/**
   279	 * Send to the Telegram Bot API. The ONLY place in this codebase permitted to call `fetch` on the Bot
   280	 * API host; `scripts/lint-telegram-egress-boundary.mjs` enforces that.
   281	 *
   282	 * Refuses rather than forwards whenever it cannot decide: an unknown method (whether it carries
   283	 * reader-visible content is unknown, so "no field" cannot be told apart from "not checked"), an
   284	 * unparseable body, and a body shape that cannot be read without consuming it.
   285	 */
