   185	 *
   186	 * Each entry is a claim that the method shows a reader nothing they could be deprived of:
   187	 *   answerCallbackQuery      a transient toast; an empty one legitimately dismisses the spinner
   188	 *   sendChatAction           the "typing…" indicator; no text at all
   189	 *   getUpdates/getMe/getFile/getChat/getChatMember   reads; nothing outbound
   190	 *   deleteWebhook/deleteMessage                      removals; no body
