codex
The authoritative parser transcription for explicit `blocks` is accurate: all accepted RichText discriminators and block fields match the server. The remaining mismatch is one level sideways: the `markdown` and `html` container arms are fed into the old two-regex text shortcut, even though rich-message formatting has its own grammar (including raw-LaTeX formulas and media references). I’m validating whether that produces one or more independent failure classes before fixing the count.
