codex
The server-side discriminator transcription checks out. The remaining defects are one level above it: the `markdown`/`html` arms still analyze source text with the legacy regexes, and the media list is treated as rendered merely because it is nonempty. I’m pinning the exact evidence and separating those from all ten pre-declared items now.
