Verdict: **UNSOUND**

Magnitude: **3 new findings — 2 DESIGN, 1 PRECISION**

- Rich Markdown/HTML formulas bypass the explicit-block formula repair. Telegram treats their contents as raw LaTeX, while the guard counts source characters. [Telegram formatting specification](https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#rich-message-formatting-options)
- Any nonempty media definition waives the guard, even though media renders only when referenced from the winning source. [InputRichMessage specification](https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputrichmessage)
- `divider` is falsely classified as rendering nothing; Telegram defines it as a rendered `<hr/>`. [InputRichBlockDivider](https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputrichblockdivider)

All 10 stated-open items are reported separately and excluded from the magnitude.
